file construction/REDS.md the row, cited by its stamp 20260907.013427 until the spine binds it
file construction/ITINERARY.md the account, the floating hash withdrawn, and the Git nib
recommend keep-going -- the next lap in this lane reads what the twelve amphora witnesses actually say, which is the half of the seating charge that outlived the count beside it.
